      "value": "hmm yeah I'm familiar with 万 and still struggle with it when trying to count yen 😅 but back on the topic at hand here, this might be difficult to prioritize as not only needs a new string but an entire side implementation of how numbers are counted just for 1 numerical system here, as @{5a983204a1528d415c5ced46|full_name} correctly predicted on their note #1.\n\nI definitely understand how this would make it at least slightly better for Japanese users to understands numbers above 9999, so still a great suggestion! But difficult to prioritize at this time",
