  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm going to talk about the numeric unit of users in the world/group card.\n\nIn Japanese, some ppl don't know about the meaning of the value using numeric units such as \"12.3K\" and \"4.5M\".\n\nWe using 「万」「億」instead of it, the example in above are to be \"1.23万\" and \"450万\".\n\nSo, I would like to be able to translate numeric units in the world/group card.",
